{"id":"naprasno","lemma":"напрасно","pos":"adv","rank":2332,"glosses":["in vain"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5b/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Том умер не напрасно.","en":"Tom didn't die in vain.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to die of natural causes","l":"умереть"},{"g":"not"},null]},{"text":"Напрасно мы туда пошли.","en":"It would've been better if we hadn't gone there.","words":[null,{"g":"we"},{"g":"there"},{"g":"to go","l":"пойти"}]},{"text":"Ты напрасно его не слушал.","en":"You were wrong in not listening to him.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"him / his"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to listen","l":"слушать"}]},{"text":"Боюсь, ты напрасно теряешь время.","en":"I'm afraid you're wasting your time.","words":[{"g":"to fear, to be afraid","l":"бояться"},{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to lose, to waste","l":"терять"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Я напрасно прождал весь день.","en":"I waited all afternoon in vain.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"all day"]]}]}